---
// The request_id is created at one endpoint and checked at the other; the layers in between only help.
// Plain inline SVG with site CSS tokens; polygon arrowheads avoid duplicate marker ids.
import DiagramIcon from './DiagramIcon.astro';
---
<figure class="unb-fig">
  <div class="unb-scroll">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 900 316" role="img" aria-label="A request_id created on the client travels through the network and app server to a UNIQUE constraint in the database. Only the two endpoints can tell a retry from a new request.">
      <text x="20" y="26" class="unb-h"><tspan data-lang-en>Only the endpoints can recognise a retry</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Chỉ hai đầu cuối mới nhận ra được lần thử lại</tspan></text>
      <line x1="115" y1="96" x2="785" y2="96" class="unb-solid is-good" />
      <line x1="115" y1="96" x2="115" y2="124" class="unb-solid is-good" />
      <line x1="785" y1="96" x2="785" y2="124" class="unb-solid is-good" />
      <text x="450" y="84" text-anchor="middle" class="unb-note is-good"><tspan data-lang-en>request_id 0286FDB8… travels the whole way</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>request_id 0286FDB8… đi suốt cả chặng đường</tspan></text>
      <rect x="20" y="130" width="190" height="64" rx="4" class="unb-box is-good" />
      <DiagramIcon name="phone" x={45} y={162} size={26} />
      <text x="139" y="158" text-anchor="middle" class="unb-in-b"><tspan data-lang-en>Client</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Client</tspan></text>
      <text x="139" y="175" text-anchor="middle" class="unb-in-m"><tspan data-lang-en>creates request_id</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>tạo request_id</tspan></text>
      <rect x="260" y="130" width="170" height="64" rx="4" class="unb-box is-dash" />
      <DiagramIcon name="network" x={285} y={162} size={26} />
      <text x="369" y="158" text-anchor="middle" class="unb-in-b"><tspan data-lang-en>Wi-Fi, TCP</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Wi-Fi, TCP</tspan></text>
      <text x="369" y="175" text-anchor="middle" class="unb-in-m"><tspan data-lang-en>lower layers</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>các tầng dưới</tspan></text>
      <rect x="480" y="130" width="150" height="64" rx="4" class="unb-box" />
      <DiagramIcon name="server" x={505} y={162} size={26} />
      <text x="579" y="158" text-anchor="middle" class="unb-in-b"><tspan data-lang-en>App server</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>App server</tspan></text>
      <text x="579" y="175" text-anchor="middle" class="unb-in-m"><tspan data-lang-en>forwards it</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>chuyển tiếp</tspan></text>
      <rect x="690" y="130" width="190" height="64" rx="4" class="unb-box is-good" />
      <DiagramIcon name="db" x={715} y={162} size={26} />
      <text x="809" y="158" text-anchor="middle" class="unb-in-b"><tspan data-lang-en>Database</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Database</tspan></text>
      <text x="809" y="175" text-anchor="middle" class="unb-in-m"><tspan data-lang-en>UNIQUE(request_id)</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>UNIQUE(request_id)</tspan></text>
      <path d="M210,162 L253,162" class="unb-solid" /><polygon points="252,157.5 252,166.5 260,162" class="unb-head" />
      <path d="M430,162 L473,162" class="unb-solid" /><polygon points="472,157.5 472,166.5 480,162" class="unb-head" />
      <path d="M630,162 L683,162" class="unb-solid" /><polygon points="682,157.5 682,166.5 690,162" class="unb-head" />
      <text x="345" y="226" text-anchor="middle" class="unb-note"><tspan data-lang-en>Useful, but they cannot tell a retry</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Hữu ích, nhưng không phân biệt được</tspan></text>
      <text x="345" y="244" text-anchor="middle" class="unb-note"><tspan data-lang-en>from a new request.</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>request thử lại với request mới.</tspan></text>
      <text x="450" y="290" text-anchor="middle" class="unb-note is-good"><tspan data-lang-en>Only the two ends know the user meant one transfer, so the check belongs there.</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Chỉ hai đầu cuối biết người dùng chỉ muốn chuyển một lần, nên việc kiểm tra phải đặt ở đó.</tspan></text>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>The lower layers cut the odds of failure, but the guarantee lives at the endpoints that carry the same id.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Các tầng dưới giảm xác suất lỗi, còn sự đảm bảo nằm ở hai đầu cuối mang cùng một id.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .unb-fig { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .unb-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .unb-fig svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .unb-fig text { font-size: 14px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .unb-fig .unb-h { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .unb-fig .unb-lane-h { font-size: 14.5px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .unb-fig .unb-lane-sub { font-size: 13px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .unb-fig .unb-in-b { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); font-size: 13.5px; }
  .unb-fig .unb-in-m { font-size: 12.5px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .unb-fig .unb-note { font-size: 13px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .unb-fig .unb-note.is-hot { fill: var(--red); font-weight: 700; }
  .unb-fig .unb-note.is-good { fill: var(--gold-icon); font-weight: 700; }
  .unb-fig .unb-mono { font-size: 12.5px; fill: var(--text-body); font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace; }
  .unb-fig .unb-tick { font-size: 12.5px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .unb-panel { fill: none; stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1; }
  .unb-panel.is-fill { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1; }
  .unb-panel.is-hot { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .unb-panel.is-good { fill: var(--gold-tint-bg); stroke: var(--gold-icon); stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .unb-box { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .unb-box.is-hot { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.6; }
  .unb-box.is-good { fill: var(--gold-tint-bg); stroke: var(--gold-icon); stroke-width: 1.6; }
  .unb-box.is-dash { stroke-dasharray: 5 4; fill: none; }
  .unb-box.is-dash.is-good { fill: none; }
  .unb-box.is-dash.is-hot { fill: none; }
  .unb-solid { fill: none; stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.8; }
  .unb-solid.is-hot { stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 2; }
  .unb-solid.is-good { stroke: var(--gold-icon); stroke-width: 2; }
  .unb-solid.is-dashedline { stroke-dasharray: 5 4; stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .unb-dashed { fill: none; stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.4; stroke-dasharray: 5 4; }
  .unb-dashed.is-hot { stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.8; }
  .unb-dashed.is-good { stroke: var(--gold-icon); stroke-width: 1.8; }
  .unb-head { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .unb-head.is-hot { fill: var(--red); }
  .unb-head.is-good { fill: var(--gold-icon); }
  .unb-step { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .unb-step.is-hot { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); }
  .unb-step.is-good { fill: var(--gold-tint-bg); stroke: var(--gold-icon); }
  .unb-fig .unb-step-n { font-size: 12.5px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .unb-fig figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
